# The stage0 compiler's model: rows grouped into entities. An entity is the
# `<name> is <kind>` row that starts it and every row after it up to the next
# `is` row; each of those rows has the entity's name as its subject (the
# formatter's layout, which stage0 requires). An entity records its name, its
# kind, and the run of rows it owns, and a map finds an entity by its name.
#
# Kinds are numbered by their row in the `kinds` table: 1 module, 2 capability,
# 3 constant, 4 operation, 5 call. Any other kind is outside the stage0 subset.

model is module
model purpose "Group rows into entities and find an entity by its name"
model path model
model imports standard.string
model imports standard.list
model imports standard.map
model imports standard.math
model imports standard.compare
model imports standard.test
model imports lexer
model imports syntax
model exports Entity
model exports Entities
model exports EntityNames
model exports buildModel

KindRow is record
KindRow purpose "One entity kind stage0 compiles, numbered by its row"
KindRow typeParameter none
KindRow field text String

kinds is table
kinds purpose "The entity kinds of the stage0 subset; a kind's number is its row's position"
kinds rowType KindRow
kinds row moduleRow 1
kinds row capabilityRow 2
kinds row constantRow 3
kinds row operationRow 4
kinds row callRow 5
kinds cell moduleRow text "module"
kinds cell capabilityRow text "capability"
kinds cell constantRow text "constant"
kinds cell operationRow text "operation"
kinds cell callRow text "call"

operationKind is constant
operationKind purpose "The number of the operation kind in the kinds table"
operationKind type Int64
operationKind value 4

Entity is record
Entity purpose "One entity: its name, its kind's number, and the run of rows it owns"
Entity typeParameter none
Entity field name syntax.Word
Entity field kind Int64
Entity field first Int64
Entity field count Int64

Entities is typeInstance
Entities purpose "Every entity of a module, in source order"
Entities instantiates list.List Entity

EntityNames is typeInstance
EntityNames purpose "The position of each entity in the entity list, by its name"
EntityNames instantiates map.Map String Int64

lookupKind is operation
lookupKind purpose "Find a kind word in the kinds table and return its number"
lookupKind invariant none
lookupKind typeParameter none
lookupKind input source String borrowed
lookupKind input word syntax.Word copied
lookupKind output Int64
lookupKind outputOwnedBy none
lookupKind raises syntax.Rejection
lookupKind effect none
lookupKind uses none
lookupKind memoryHeap false
lookupKind async false
lookupKind maxRecursion none
lookupKind label begin loopKind none
lookupKind label begin within none
lookupKind label scan loopKind forEach
lookupKind label scan within none
lookupKind label scan maxIterations 5
lookupKind label scan over kinds
lookupKind label compare loopKind none
lookupKind label compare within scan
lookupKind label found loopKind none
lookupKind label found within none
lookupKind label missing loopKind none
lookupKind label missing within none
lookupKind label outside loopKind none
lookupKind label outside within none
lookupKind let one Int64 1 immutable
lookupKind let position Int64 0 mutable
lookupKind at begin do readStart
lookupKind at begin do readOffset
lookupKind at begin do readLength
lookupKind at begin do cutWord
lookupKind at begin branch ifError cutWord goto outside else goto scan
lookupKind at scan branch ifNext kinds bind entry KindRow goto compare else goto missing
lookupKind at compare do countRow
lookupKind at compare set position nextPosition
lookupKind at compare do readText
lookupKind at compare do sameText
lookupKind at compare branch if isSame goto found else goto scan
lookupKind at found return ok position
lookupKind at missing do makeMissing
lookupKind at missing return error missingError
lookupKind at outside do makeOutside
lookupKind at outside return error outsideError

