buildModel is operation
buildModel purpose "Group rows into entities by their `is` rows and enter each entity's name in a map"
buildModel invariant groupsEntities "Each `<name> is <kind>` row starts an entity of that kind owning it and the rows after it up to the next `is` row; kinds are numbered module 1, capability 2, constant 3, operation 4, call 5"
buildModel invariant namesEntities "Each entity's name maps to its position in the entity list"
buildModel invariant rejectsOutsideModel "Another kind is unsupportedKind, a row whose subject is not the entity above it is strayRow, a name declared twice is duplicateName, and an operation not named main is notMain"
buildModel typeParameter none
buildModel input source String borrowed
buildModel input words syntax.Words borrowed
buildModel input rows syntax.Rows borrowed
buildModel input entities Entities borrowedMutable
buildModel input names EntityNames borrowedMutable
buildModel output none
buildModel outputOwnedBy none
buildModel raises syntax.Rejection
buildModel effect none
buildModel uses none
buildModel memoryHeap true
buildModel async false
buildModel maxRecursion none
buildModel label begin loopKind none
buildModel label begin within none
buildModel label visit loopKind forEach
buildModel label visit within none
buildModel label visit maxIterations rowCount
buildModel label visit over rows
buildModel label readRow loopKind none
buildModel label readRow within visit
buildModel label sort loopKind none
buildModel label sort within visit
buildModel label opening loopKind none
buildModel label opening within visit
buildModel label shapeCheck loopKind none
buildModel label shapeCheck within visit
buildModel label readKindWord loopKind none
buildModel label readKindWord within visit
buildModel label nameCheck loopKind none
buildModel label nameCheck within visit
buildModel label duplicateCheck loopKind none
buildModel label duplicateCheck within visit
buildModel label operationCheck loopKind none
buildModel label operationCheck within visit
buildModel label mainCheck loopKind none
buildModel label mainCheck within visit
buildModel label mainChecked loopKind none
buildModel label mainChecked within visit
buildModel label openIt loopKind none
buildModel label openIt within visit
buildModel label continuing loopKind none
buildModel label continuing within visit
buildModel label sameCheck loopKind none
buildModel label sameCheck within visit
buildModel label subjectChecked loopKind none
buildModel label subjectChecked within visit
buildModel label advance loopKind none
buildModel label advance within visit
buildModel label finished loopKind none
buildModel label finished within none
buildModel label done loopKind none
buildModel label done within none
buildModel label longIsRow loopKind none
buildModel label longIsRow within none
buildModel label duplicate loopKind none
buildModel label duplicate within none
buildModel label notMain loopKind none
buildModel label notMain within none
buildModel label stray loopKind none
buildModel label stray within none
buildModel label isCheckFailed loopKind none
buildModel label isCheckFailed within none
buildModel label closePreviousFailed loopKind none
buildModel label closePreviousFailed within none
buildModel label classifyFailed loopKind none
buildModel label classifyFailed within none
buildModel label copySubjectFailed loopKind none
buildModel label copySubjectFailed within none
buildModel label nameIsMainFailed loopKind none
buildModel label nameIsMainFailed within none
buildModel label subjectCheckFailed loopKind none
buildModel label subjectCheckFailed within none
buildModel label closeLastFailed loopKind none
buildModel label closeLastFailed within none
buildModel let zero Int64 0 immutable
buildModel let one Int64 1 immutable
buildModel let two Int64 2 immutable
buildModel let three Int64 3 immutable
buildModel let yes Bool true immutable
buildModel let isWord String "is" immutable
buildModel let mainName String "main" immutable
buildModel let rowIndex Int64 0 mutable
buildModel let open Bool false mutable
buildModel let openName syntax.Word unset mutable
buildModel let openKind Int64 0 mutable
buildModel let openFirst Int64 0 mutable
buildModel at begin do countRows
buildModel at begin do makeNameKind
buildModel at begin do makeOrigin
buildModel at begin do makePlaceholder
buildModel at begin set openName placeholder
buildModel at begin goto visit
buildModel at visit branch ifNext rows bind row syntax.Row goto readRow else goto finished
buildModel at readRow do readFirst
buildModel at readRow do readCount
buildModel at readRow do readSubject
buildModel at readRow do findPredicate
buildModel at readRow do readPredicate
buildModel at readRow do isCheck
buildModel at readRow branch ifError isCheck goto isCheckFailed else goto sort
buildModel at sort branch if isIs goto opening else goto continuing
buildModel at opening do closePrevious
buildModel at opening branch ifError closePrevious goto closePreviousFailed else goto shapeCheck
buildModel at shapeCheck do threeCheck
buildModel at shapeCheck branch if isThree goto readKindWord else goto longIsRow
buildModel at readKindWord do findKind
buildModel at readKindWord do readKind
buildModel at readKindWord do classify
buildModel at readKindWord branch ifError classify goto classifyFailed else goto nameCheck
buildModel at nameCheck do copySubject
buildModel at nameCheck branch ifError copySubject goto copySubjectFailed else goto duplicateCheck
buildModel at duplicateCheck do findName
buildModel at duplicateCheck branch if taken goto duplicate else goto operationCheck
buildModel at operationCheck do kindCheck
buildModel at operationCheck branch if isOperation goto mainCheck else goto openIt
buildModel at mainCheck do nameIsMain
buildModel at mainCheck branch ifError nameIsMain goto nameIsMainFailed else goto mainChecked
buildModel at mainChecked branch if isMain goto openIt else goto notMain
buildModel at openIt set open yes
buildModel at openIt set openName subject
buildModel at openIt set openKind kind
buildModel at openIt set openFirst rowIndex
buildModel at openIt goto advance
buildModel at continuing branch if open goto sameCheck else goto stray
buildModel at sameCheck do subjectCheck
buildModel at sameCheck branch ifError subjectCheck goto subjectCheckFailed else goto subjectChecked
buildModel at subjectChecked branch if sameSubject goto advance else goto stray
buildModel at advance do stepRow
buildModel at advance set rowIndex nextRow
buildModel at advance goto visit
buildModel at finished do closeLast
buildModel at finished branch ifError closeLast goto closeLastFailed else goto done
buildModel at done return ok none
buildModel at longIsRow do makeLongIsRow
buildModel at longIsRow return error longIsRowError
buildModel at duplicate do makeDuplicate
buildModel at duplicate return error duplicateError
buildModel at notMain do makeNotMain
buildModel at notMain return error notMainError
buildModel at stray do makeStray
buildModel at stray return error strayError
buildModel at isCheckFailed return error isCheckError
buildModel at closePreviousFailed return error closePreviousError
buildModel at classifyFailed return error classifyError
buildModel at copySubjectFailed return error copySubjectError
buildModel at nameIsMainFailed return error nameIsMainError
buildModel at subjectCheckFailed return error subjectCheckError
buildModel at closeLastFailed return error closeLastError

